---
title: Installation
description: How to set up the project locally.
order: 1
---

## Prerequisites

- [Bun](https://bun.sh) 1.4+
- Node.js 22+

## Setup

```bash
bun install
bun run dev
```

The project uses [shadcn-svelte](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com) for its UI primitives. New primitives can be added with:

```bash
bun x shadcn-svelte@latest add <component>
```

## Verifying your setup

```bash
bun run check
bun run build
```

## Installing this registry into another project

Any item can be installed directly, without cloning this repo:

```bash
bun x shadcn-svelte@latest add https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/button.json
```

To reference items by name instead of the full URL, add this registry to the consuming project's `components.json`:

```json
{
  "registries": {
    "@design-system-ui": "https://design-system-starter-svelte-docs.vercel.app/r/{name}.json"
  }
}
```

```bash
bun x shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui/button
```

See [Registry](/docs/registry) for how items are built and served.
